OL,3,GNEWSAMedieval leprosy hospital
OL,4,Auncovered in Lincoln
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe walls of what is thought to be one
OL,7,Fof medieval England's earliest and
OL,8,Flargest leprosy hospitals have been
OL,9,Funcovered in Lincoln by Time Team
OL,10,Farchaeologists.
OL,12,FA three-day dig started on Friday on
OL,13,Fthe South Common at the site of the
OL,14,FHospital of the Holy Innocents, which
OL,15,Fhoused up to 20 people with leprosy
OL,16,Faround the late 11th to early 12th
OL,17,FCenturies.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,386,380,200,160,0,100
