OL,3,GNEWSAMedieval leprosy hospital
OL,4,Auncovered in Lincoln
OL,5,
OL,6,FTime Team's Prof Carenza Lewis said
OL,7,Fthey had found traces of square
OL,8,Ffeatures where it is thought people
OL,9,Fwere housed, which "haven't been
OL,10,Fexcavated before, anywhere".
OL,12,FThe dig marks the beginning of a
OL,13,Fthree-year project backed by the
OL,14,FNational Lottery Heritage Fund.
